category: Libs
build-depends: cygport autoconf-archive gettext-devel libiconv-devel
sdesc: "Read binary Excel files from C/C++ (utilities)"
ldesc: "This is libxls, a C library for reading Excel files in the nasty old binary
OLE format, plus a command-line tool for converting XLS to CSV (named,
appropriately enough, xls2csv)."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/libxls/libxls
